bpftune (0.4.13) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix: pass current socket's rate_delivered to tcp_metric_calc
    instead of the algorithm's all-time-best rate. Previously the
    rate term was frozen per algorithm (only changed when the alg
    set a new personal best), making half the metric historic while
    the RTT half was live per-socket.

 -- Christophe Deppe <cddeppe@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:09:38 +0200

bpftune (0.4.12) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix: only sockets with >= METRIC_MIN_SEGS total segments update
    the per-algorithm metric and bucket references. Prevents small
    control sockets from pinning the bucket min_rtt to an unachievable
    floor, which had caused every real connection to saturate the RTT
    term and lock the tuner onto whichever algorithm got the poisoned
    bucket first.

 -- Christophe Deppe <cddeppe@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 16:54:55 +0200

